{"title": "Brian", "pageid": 45039, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Brian", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Dwarves", "Characters in Act One", "Characters in the Goblin Camp"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Brian</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Brian</b> is a dead adventurer in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aradin\" title=\"Aradin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/70px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/105px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/140px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/70px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">I'd give you a map of the temple and wish you a happy funeral, but my mate Brian kept hold of it like his own todger. Goblins made short of the fat old chunk.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Aradin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Aradin\">Aradin</a>, being less than reverent about his fallen comrade</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Brian was a member of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aradin\" title=\"Aradin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/25px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/38px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/50px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aradin's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png/25px-Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Portrait_Aradin_Beno.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aradin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Aradin\">Aradin's</a> adventuring expedition that was hired by the <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> to find an artefact known as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/38px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/50px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nightsong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\">Nightsong</a>. The group included <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remira\" title=\"Remira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/25px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/38px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/50px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/25px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remira\" title=\"Remira\">Remira</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barth\" title=\"Barth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/25px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/38px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/50px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/25px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barth\" title=\"Barth\">Barth</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Liam\" title=\"Liam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/25px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/38px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/50px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Liam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/25px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Liam\" title=\"Liam\">Liam</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a>. Although they reached the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a>, the group was attacked by <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">goblins</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>. Brian was killed, cut to pieces, and cooked into a spit roast. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/38px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/50px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Klagga\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\">Klagga</a> took all of Brian's belongings, including a pair of blue pants and a poem he had written. This poem can serve as a map leading to the Nightsong.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Klagga%27s_Pants\" title=\"Klagga's Pants\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Underwear_Dwarves_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3